  "ruleText": "Lan 103.02 Composition of the Board. The board shall consist of 5 members who meet the eligibility requirements of RSA 310-A:55.\n\nSource. #5934, eff 12-9-94, EXPIRED: 12-9-00\n\nNew. #7425, INTERIM, eff 1-13-01, EXPIRED: 7-12-01\n\nNew. #7547, eff 8-25-01",
